//- template (_fe-pricing-detail.pug). Names, prices, destinations and the
//- featured flag live here so the two cannot drift; each grid keeps the copy
//- that is particular to its form (the compact grid's four-line summaries,
//- the detail cards' full feature markup with their explainers).
